::ex1-3-power::[html]If A is a four-element set, how many elements does its power set P(A) contain? {
    ~4#Incorrect
    ~8#Incorrect
    =16#Correct
    ~24#Incorrect
}

// Exercises 1, Ex 7(6) | set-identities | difficulty 1
::ex1-7-id::[html]Which equality is true for every set A? {
    ~A Δ A \= A#Incorrect
    ~A ∩ ∅ \= A#Incorrect
    =A Δ ∅ \= A#Correct
    ~A ∪ ∅ \= ∅#Incorrect
}

