::ex5-5-group::[html]Which of the following algebraic structures ⟨carrier, operation⟩ is a group? {
    ~⟨N, +⟩#Incorrect
    ~⟨Z, ·⟩#Incorrect
    ~⟨N, ·⟩#Incorrect
    =⟨Z, +⟩#Correct
}

